      <title>The fit: ESPN grades Downs the deadline's 'best environmental improvement' - from the Colts' 31st-ranked passing EPA to Andy Reid's screen-and-quick-pass machine</title>
      <link>https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50443388/2026-nfl-trade-deadline-winners-losers-best-worst-deals</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50443388/2026-nfl-trade-deadline-winners-losers-best-worst-deals</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
