      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://espnmedia-cdn.akamaized.net/espn/media/common/2026/1110/ss_20261110_152324738_3735523/ss_20261110_152324738_3735523.jpg" alt="NFL trade deadline illustration" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Indianapolis ranked 31st in EPA per dropback and last in explosive pass rate; the Chiefs sit 8th and 7th. Downs hits free agency after the season, so KC gets a motivated slot separator for Day 3 picks.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;No team throws more screens and quick passes than the Chiefs, which will serve Downs' separation ability from the slot well.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50443388/2026-nfl-trade-deadline-winners-losers-best-worst-deals">Ben Solak, ESPN</a></blockquote>
