    <item>
      <title>Mahomes' elbow MRI shows no major injury; Reid calls him day-to-day and 'in good spirits' with Atlanta up Sunday</title>
      <link>https://atozsports.com/nfl/kansas-city-chiefs-news/chiefs-andy-reid-injury-updates-patrick-mahomes-xavier-worthy-jaylon-moore-monday/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://atozsports.com/nfl/kansas-city-chiefs-news/chiefs-andy-reid-injury-updates-patrick-mahomes-xavier-worthy-jaylon-moore-monday/</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 16:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Chiefs</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://atozsports.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-11-08T175616Z_216724169_MT1USATODAY30312323_RTRMADP_3_NFL-NEW-YORK-JETS-AT-KANSAS-CITY-CHIEFS-scaled.jpg" alt="Patrick Mahomes during the win over the Jets" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Reid says all three of Mahomes (elbow), Worthy (hamstring) and Jaylon Moore (ankle) are day-to-day. Worthy's best case is a couple of weeks; the worst is an IR-return stint. Joshua Ezeudu would start at RT if Moore sits.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;It was more positive news than negative news on Patrick. It looks like it's just a matter of some rehab in there and getting rid of some of the soreness, and we'll just see where it goes from there. But he's in good spirits today.&rdquo; - <a href="https://atozsports.com/nfl/kansas-city-chiefs-news/chiefs-andy-reid-injury-updates-patrick-mahomes-xavier-worthy-jaylon-moore-monday/">Andy Reid, Chiefs head coach</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://apnews.com/article/kansas-city-chiefs-patrick-mahomes-57cc7631322f8b82b5466d03fdb63f72">AP</a> &middot; <a href="https://atozsports.com/nfl/kansas-city-chiefs-news/chiefs-andy-reid-injury-updates-patrick-mahomes-xavier-worthy-jaylon-moore-monday/">A to Z Sports</a></p>
