      <title>The Marina Safeway towers won city approval Nov. 6 via AB 2011 - but a federal lawsuit filed in September could freeze construction until a February ruling</title>
      <link>https://www.sfgate.com/local/article/sf-approves-safeway-towers-22524197.php</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.sfgate.com/local/article/sf-approves-safeway-towers-22524197.php</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 06:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>San Francisco</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://jacobpedd.github.io/daily-digest/images/safeway-towers.png" alt="Generated illustration of the proposed towers above the Marina Safeway" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>YesAND Foundation and Neighborhoods United SF allege documented toxic waste at 11 and 15 Marina Blvd. and say the city fast-tracked the 848-unit project. Align Real Estate says it has no timeline to break ground; a motion-to-dismiss ruling is expected in February 2027.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;We appreciate the diligent work of city staff in moving this important project forward. This approval brings us one step closer to welcoming new families to a neighborhood that has seen far too little housing development, while delivering a modern grocery store for the entire community.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.sfgate.com/local/article/sf-approves-safeway-towers-22524197.php">David Balducci, Align Real Estate</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.sfgate.com/local/article/sf-approves-safeway-towers-22524197.php">SFGATE</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/11%3A%20loved%20%22The%20Marina%20Safeway%20towers%20won%20city%20appr...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/11%3A%20meh%20on%20%22The%20Marina%20Safeway%20towers%20won%20city%20appr...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/11%3A%20less%20like%20%22The%20Marina%20Safeway%20towers%20won%20city%20appr...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//www.sfgate.com/local/article/sf-approves-safeway-towers-22524197.php%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
